# H1: hand the cards back to production. This is the LAST job of the window and it runs even when any earlier job failed, stalled or hung (a hang can leave all four cards wedged with production down):
# the status of every board, the all-four reset, the fabric re-measure (it must pass before production serves), then the node agent starts again and waits for its container to answer /v1/models.
# The agent serves the rig daemon's local :latest, which this window did NOT move, so the placement the owner's /deploy then makes is TODAY'S PRODUCTION RECIPE (profile c2-packed-tp4: audits off,
# the pinned sampler in the verify trace).
# NEVER place a gate arm or this window's image: not the warm4 twins, not the speed twin, not any gate-only profile.
# AN OWNER /deploy IS STILL NEEDED, always, to place today's production recipe or anything new: this job starts the agent with nothing placed; it never includes a deploy, a :latest retag or a placement call.
# If the fabric re-measure fails the job stops before agentstart: production stays down until a board is healed.
# Pass: all four boards enumerate after the reset, the fabric probe passes, /v1/models answers Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B:tt and a chat completes, and the engine log shows profile c2-packed-tp4 with the audits off
# and QWEN_FAST_PACKED_SAMPLER_IN_TRACE=1. Duration (estimate): 25 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card tp4/warm4 window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/warm4 and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or
# a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The window's jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-warm4a is a PLACEHOLDER for ONE FRESH tag, built by B0 from the pushed tp4/warm4 commit; the driver
# substitutes it in every template once the image is built. A later commit needs a new tag.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset fabric agentstart
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-warm4a
